  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "In a large saucepan, combine the parsley, pimento, salt, pepper, tomato sauce, and fresh tomatoes. Bring to a boil. Add carrots, celery and garlic. Cook until carrots are cooked, but still firm.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in a little water and juice of 1 lemon. Place fish into pan without stirring. Baste fish with liquid. Add sugar.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "When the fish is cooked, remove from heat. Let cool and serve cold",
